Package: secubox-gitea
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, secubox-core (>= 1.0.0)
Description: SecuBox Gitea — self-hosted Git server (LXC)
 Manages a Gitea Git server (private repositories, issues, PRs)
 running in its own LXC container. SecuBox wires up nginx vhost,
 ACME TLS, backup integration, and a web management dashboard
 around the upstream Gitea install.
